            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Azathioprine (AZA) is commonly used in inflammatory bowel disease and many other medical diseases. The most common adverse events of AZA include gastrointestinal effects, hepatotoxicity, myelotoxicity and pancreatitis.</AbstractText>
